Package: totaljs-fetch
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Total.js <repository@totaljs.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: iproute2, procps
Homepage: https://www.totaljs.com
Description: The Total.js summary of the system for the terminal
 The command totalfetch shows the mark of Total.js in green next to the system,
 the kernel, the memory, the disk and the address of the computer, and greets
 with it once in every interactive terminal. To turn the greeting off for a
 person, create the file ~/.config/totalfetch/off.
